{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261050/extras/e9e30800d0cd51fe1f37b0969a2c4ffc.poster.avif?t=1770631984\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261050/extras/e9e30800d0cd51fe1f37b0969a2c4ffc.webm?t=1770631984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261050/extras/e9e30800d0cd51fe1f37b0969a2c4ffc.mp4?t=1770631984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Hats and Guns is a roguelite deckbuilder set in the Wild West. Play as different characters with unique gameplays. Upgrade your cards and collect powerful weapons and relics as you attempt to survive in the heart of a dangerous procedurally-generated desert.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical combat<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261050/extras/1610aa913518cbaf9ea2366f009dbfcd.poster.avif?t=1770631984\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261050/extras/1610aa913518cbaf9ea2366f009dbfcd.webm?t=1770631984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261050/extras/1610aa913518cbaf9ea2366f009dbfcd.mp4?t=1770631984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is grid-based, and accuracy is the central system of combat. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, it doesn\u2019t determine the chance to hit the target but the amount of damage dealt. No room for randomness!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll need to pay close attention to your position, resources and accuracy management to maximize damage and stay alive in these challenging encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deckbuilding<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261050/extras/e4cc3fde003a62e340e6080a7f0a6f2c.poster.avif?t=1770631984\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261050/extras/e4cc3fde003a62e340e6080a7f0a6f2c.webm?t=1770631984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261050/extras/e4cc3fde003a62e340e6080a7f0a6f2c.mp4?t=1770631984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 card upgrades to assign to 5 basic card types (accuracy, speed, dexterity, reflex and strength) to create powerful combos and optimize your deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 playable characters<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261050/extras/7500030c8436c27efa471a818d56e3a3.avif?t=1770631984\" width=600 height=280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 unique gameplay characters are available, each with a passive skill, a starting weapon and a unique starting deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural desert and moral choices<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261050/extras/f137ca2e14e684409e55c3764fe42cff.poster.avif?t=1770631984\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261050/extras/f137ca2e14e684409e55c3764fe42cff.webm?t=1770631984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261050/extras/f137ca2e14e684409e55c3764fe42cff.mp4?t=1770631984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through the wilderness, meticulously choosing your path. Collect equipment to become more powerful and reach your goal, a fearsome gang leader! <br>Will you become as cruel as he is to get your revenge, or will you stay on the right path? </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3261050?t=1770631984","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3261050?t=1770631984","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261050/1643460fe958f9565722be381d0db50d7d1a6c64/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770631984","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261050/1643460fe958f9565722be381d0db50d7d1a6c64/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770631984","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3978770,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261050/extras/e9e30800d0cd51fe1f37b0969a2c4ffc.poster.avif?t=1770631984\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261050/extras/e9e30800d0cd51fe1f37b0969a2c4ffc.webm?t=1770631984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261050/extras/e9e30800d0cd51fe1f37b0969a2c4ffc.mp4?t=1770631984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Hats and Guns is a roguelite deckbuilder se